# Krenix Dev Notes - Index

Condensed working memory for Claude Code sessions. Read this at the start of a session instead of scrolling conversation history. Each task log is a separate note linked below.

## How this works
- After finishing a meaningful task, Claude Code appends a short entry here (or a linked note for bigger items): what changed, why, and any decisions/tradeoffs made.
- This folder is gitignored - it's local working memory, not project documentation.
- Full detail lives in the linked notes; keep entries here to 1-3 lines.

## Log
