### 2026-07-19 - New logo, super-admin re-theme, home page redesign, responsive + scrollbar
Six-part batch on branch live-testing:
1. **New logo**: `New Krenix logo.jpeg` (teal-flame phoenix) was a flat JPEG with a checkerboard baked in (opaque RGB). Auto-removed the bg with PIL (saturation+brightness key, fade dark wisps, despeckle) → `public/brand/krenix-phoenix.png` (transparent). Wired into `KrenixLogo.tsx` (mark) + `DashboardLogo.tsx`. Flawless on the dark sidebar; clean on light too.
