3. **Super-admin → Éclat light**: layout (dark sidebar + light content, mirrors dashboard), SuperAdminNav (responsive: vertical sidebar desktop / horizontal chip strip mobile), SuperAdminNotifications, StepUpModal, and all pages (overview/payments/clients/stores/security/audit). Sidebar hidden <lg with a mobile nav strip. "Super Admin" tag uses dash-gold.
4. **Home page** (`src/app/page.tsx`): full rebuild to Éclat light — Bodoni Moda display + Manrope, sage-green + gold, teal phoenix, ghost-phoenix hero watermark. Heavy Framer Motion: scroll-progress bar, hero parallax + line-by-line blur reveals, light dashboard mockup (mirrors real product, dark sidebar), marquee, count-ups, path draw-in, hover lifts, magnetic CTAs, mobile menu. Content/links unchanged (register/login/#features/#pricing/#faq).
5. **Responsive**: verified 0 horizontal overflow at 375px on home, login, and store (demo-beaute); super-admin + dashboard built responsive.
6. Verified: `tsc` clean, `next build` passes, eslint clean on changed files (one pre-existing SuperAdminNotifications warning left as-is). Browser screenshots can't settle due to infinite Framer loops — verified via DOM/computed-styles/page-text instead.
